":221150509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1269455533,"text":"フン、きっとあいつの家族がわしのことをよく思ってなくて、一緒にいてほしくなかったから、軽策荘から引っ越したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[221150510]},{"nodeId":221150510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":2481593973,"text":"見てるがいい、いつかわしが成功したら、見直してもらうぞ！そして幼馴染に書いた本を全世界に売るんだ！","nextNodeIds":[221150511]},{"nodeId":221150511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":4245922341,"text":"そうしたらあいつらがどこにいても、わしはもうあの頃のわしじゃないって分かるはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[221150512]},{"nodeId":221150512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":1438177301,"text":"そして…あいつと再会することだって…でもその前に、まずはこの本を書き終えないと。","nextNodeIds":[221150513]},{"nodeId":221150513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1624,"speakerName":"常九","textMapHash":476907645,"text":"…すまない、勝手に喋り出して。はあ、どうすればいい小説を書けるかについて考えておかないとな…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2211505,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100495,100513,100514"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_DEL_ALL_SPECIFIC_PACK_ITEM"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1624"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2211508,"order":11,"stepDescription":"若心と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":1292488018,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2211506,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHE